        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "First it’s the calm look on her face. Then people notice her "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "hair clip",
            "zh": "发夹"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Many things about Huang Yuting turn heads."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " The "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "shooting",
            "ref": "v-shooting"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " star is just really good at her sport. At the recent "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "ISSF World Cup Final",
            "zh": "国际射联射击世界杯总决赛"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", she led the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "women’s 10 m air rifle",
            "zh": "女子 10 米气步枪"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " competition from start to finish. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Huang put on great performances at the 2024 Olympic Games and the 2022 Asian Games, too."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Her calmness in front of the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "target",
            "ref": "v-target"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " may easily fool us, but Huang is only 18 years old. She grew up in an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ordinary",
            "ref": "v-ordinary"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " family in Taizhou, Zhejiang. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " She also studied hard in school."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The turning point came one day in 2016. Huang’s school had some visitors. Those were coaches from a local sports school. They were looking for young talents. They asked the kids to each build a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "pyramid",
            "zh": "金字塔"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " out of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bullet shells",
            "zh": "弹壳"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " But Huang still made it. She was chosen to train as a shooter."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Huang tried her best to balance her new “hobby” with her schoolwork. Every day after school, she practiced shooting for an hour. Then, she went home to do her homework. After only one year of training, Huang began winning shooting competitions. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "As a young shooter and student, Huang has many more competitions and tests ahead. But with her hard work and talent, she’ll surely continue to hit the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bullseye",
            "zh": "靶心"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—both on and off the shooting range."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
